# 2025-09-23
* Simpler Embeddings using structural features

Used a simpler embedding technique that doesn't depend on an embedding model or 3rd party libraries.
Instead, it uses a combination of structural features such as function name, parameters, and return type to generate embeddings.

This removed an external dependency, makes per repo setup and indexing faster, and reduced the storage footprint.

